Download the AIFI CellTypist model binaries manually from
https://apps.allenimmunology.org/aifi/resources/imm-health-atlas/downloads/models/
and place them here with the filenames listed in `../INPUT_FILES.md`.

The pipeline does not download or redistribute these binaries: their current
download links redirect through a Google-authenticated Allen service, while the
downloader deliberately does not handle credentials or interactive login.
Redistribution terms must be confirmed before publishing them. The files used
for this project were obtained on 2025-06-27.
